WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.370
Is 9 take away 4 the same as 4 take away 9?

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:04.920
No.

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.080
Order matters with subtraction.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:11.510
Swap the numbers and you get something different.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:14.016
Adding doesn't care. Subtracting does.
